ing payroll every cycle), so bankruptcy is guaranteed once the grace period elapses -- fires for real at tick 105 (`[tick 100] BANKRUPTCY! The mine is seized.`), stays true through the rest of the file's 180-tick budget. wellBeing and safety both climb toward their ceiling despite the collapse, same non-neglect mechanic as Findings #43/#44 (no blasting happens anywhere in this file, so none of the 10 hires is ever dispatched into harm). Verified in both command mode and a real browser, 74/74 steps, 0 failures."
